# Keep the build context small and free of secrets: the images are built from source, never from a developer's .env or build output.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/api/src/generated
.ai-radar
.impeccable
.claude
.agents
.cursor
.codex
docs/screenshots
*.log
